SUMMARY:Thompson Creek from Pisgah Inn - 7.5 Mi\, 2400 Ft EG
DESCRIPTION:The Asheville Hiking Group\nThis is a down-then-up\, out-and-b
 ack hike making it harder in my opinion. There are some steep and rocky se
 ctions so please be prepared for a harder hike and realize up is the only 
 way back. We will keep a moderate pace but take breaks for water and to lo
 ok at the views. I will be watching the weather closely this weekend and w
 ill cancel if we get too much water. We should have some good fall colors 
 although this year seems a bit muted.\n\nhttps://www.alltrails.com/trail/u
 s/north-carolina/thompson-ridge-trail\n\n**CARPOOL**\nLet's meet at the Fr
 ench Broad Overlook at 8:30. If you want to go directly to the trailhead\,
  please let me know and use the directions in AllTrails. We will start at 
 the Pisgah Inn parking lot on the NE corner by the MST trailhead at 9am.\n
 \n**WEATHER**\nThe weather currently might be okay for Monday but I'll wat
 ch the weather and post a cancellation message by 7:00 AM if there is a ch
 ance of severe weather or lightning during this time period..\n\n**QUESTIO
 NS?**\nYou can message me through MeetUp until 8:00 AM the day of. Cell re
 ception may be sketchy\, but you can try to text or call me up to the star
 t of the hike: (508) 965-2333.\n\n**LEGALESE**\nThis Asheville Hiking Grou
 p event involves hiking and\, possibly\, transportation to and from the me
 etup site. Participants are responsible for their own safety and affirm th
 at they have the appropriate skills\, physical conditioning\, equipment\, 
 and supplies. Hiking may involve risks to oneself and property. Neither yo
 ur hike organizer nor Asheville Hiking Group can assure your safety nor el
 iminate all risks. Participants assume full responsibility for any injurie
 s\, damages\, or losses.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/ashevillehikinggroup/events/316900333
 /
