SUMMARY:Scenic AVL #6: Mount Royal Roller
DESCRIPTION:The Asheville Hiking Group\nNote: Hike on Thursday this week.\
 n\nRating: Strenuous for Elevation Gain\nDistance: 5 miles\nPace: 3.2 mph\
 nElevation Gain: 1000\, in the first 1.5 miles.\nSurface: Road\nDogs: On l
 eash\nBears: Possible\nRoute:\n[https://www.alltrails.com/explore/map/mt-r
 oyal-loop-565767e](https://www.alltrails.com/explore/map/mt-royal-loop-565
 767e)\n\nBring a headlamp or flashlight.\n\nScenic Asheville Series: There
  are 9 hikes in the series\; hike them all and receive an [attractive](htt
 ps://docs.google.com/drawings/d/1goXUXfzUBqhB4_UeCxodlk4ZPeCCgqZrWK2EUJvk_
 vI/edit?usp=drivesdk) badge for your backpack. Check your progress [HERE](
 https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1XUm-X1_OhxKIi8JU5rhjsW37cAl4yYx8yB
 _NEjjI5Lk/edit?usp=drivesdk).\n\nRSVP and On-Time Start:\n\n*If you decide
  you cannot come\, please change your RSVP status to "Not Going" as soon a
 s possible so wait-listers can have sufficient notice.\n\n**Guests:** If y
 ou bring a guest or plus one\, please make sure they are fit enough to mak
 e the climb 🪜 - this is the most strenuous hike in the series.\n\nDiscl
 aimer and Release of Liability:\nThis activity involves hiking on city str
 eets that may have traffic. Participants are responsible for their safety 
 on streets and trails. The organizer of this trip is a volunteer and not a
  professional guide. The function of the organizer is only to organize thi
 s trip. If you sign up or participate in this event you acknowledge that y
 ou freely and voluntarily agree to assume all risks of injuries\, illnesse
 s\, and damages arising from\, as a result of\, and associated with this e
 vent. In addition\, you acknowledge that you agree to the Meetup terms: [h
 ttps://www.meetup.com/terms](https://www.meetup.com/terms)\nRead less
